DINING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"服務",null,null,null,"服務",null,"0ahUKEwj4-eL5u9eWAxXSmK8BHcdoNuYQ3IcHCDAoBg",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwj4-eL5u9eWAxXSmK8BHcdoNuYQ3IcHCDEoBw",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_NOISE_LEVEL"],"你覺得吵雜程度如何？",[[[["E:DINING_NOISE_LEVEL_QUIET"],"安靜，適合交談",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwj4-eL5u9eWAxXSmK8BHcdoNuYQ3YcHCDMoAA"]],1],null,null,"吵雜程度",null,"0ahUKEwj4-eL5u9eWAxXSmK8BHcdoNuYQ3IcHCDIoCA",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["👉雞塊咖哩蛋包飯4號餐-169元👈\n1.雞塊咖哩蛋包飯：\n感覺份量比菜單上的少很多，白飯大概就一個玻璃碗倒過來，雞塊大約7-8小塊，超級小的那種…吃不出肉的嚼勁…馬鈴薯、紅蘿蔔2-3塊，也切很小塊…綠花椰菜也是切很細…\n盤子用這麼大的，結果份量蠻少的，咖哩醬吃起來偏鹹。\n2.海帶湯：\n原以為會是味噌湯，但實際上是海帶湯，胡椒粉灑很多，喝起來偏鹹。\n3.茶碗蒸：\n茶碗蒸吃起來好吃，裡面有一小塊香菇、魚板。\n4.飲料：\n小小的飲料杯可以無限暢飲，飲料機就是一般常去火鍋店看到的，有「可樂、雪碧、蘋果汁」。\n5.結論：\n如果單點主食可能會覺得貴，餐點的肉量偏少，點套餐會比較好一些，只有收現金、不開立發票。",null,[0,109]]]],[],[null,null,482,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kwNFNuUk9iRkZqT0RsWVREaE5OR1ZST1hCTVgzYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x637087faad9d8ecf!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOi04SnRObFFjODlYTDhNNGVROXBMX3c%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kwNFNuUk9iRkZqT0RsWVREaE5OR1ZST1hCTVgzYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kwNFNuUk9iRkZqT0RsWVREaE5OR1ZST1hCTVgzYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kwNFNuUk9iRkZqT0RsWVREaE5OR1ZST1hCTVgzYxILMGRuWHBTcDY1aFYaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09pMDRTblJPYkZGak9EbFlURGhOTkdWUk9YQk1YM2MSCzBkblhwU3A2NWhWIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARz46drfqHcGMqCzBkblhwU3A2NWhW\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwj4-eL5u9eWAxXSmK8BHcdoNuYQoykINCgJ"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwi3j-f5u9eWAxXM9hYFHRIRPD0Q0pMFCAIoAA"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwj4-eL5u9eWAxXSmK8BHcdoNuYQ0pMFCCUoAA"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xSYU1ITlNjbEJmY1hGSldYZzJNVzV6WXkxWU5GRRAB",["0x0:0x637087faad9d8ecf",null,1782708993788204,1782710258143180,[null,null,["